  "checks": [
    "Pure Build, frozen settings, independent and parallel applications with different defaults and feature enablement",
    "Default/named identity; closing one application leaves the other operational",
    "Global middleware on matched and unmatched requests; ordinary and plugin routes merge with duplicate rejection",
    "Cookie authentication always requires CSRF, including API routes; bearer-only actors stay stateless",
    "HTTP completion attribution, bytes/outcomes, early rejection, panic/Goexit isolation and ownership through observer return",
    "Owned append-only logging, startup rollback, closed writers and metadata-only automatic access records",
    "Independent executable consumer: real PostgreSQL, two actor models, cache, multipart uploads, imaging and storage",
    "Wrong-actor compiler rejection and real gopls actor/service/generated-key completion",
    "Full native tests/vet for root and independent fixtures, PostgreSQL/Redis, TypeScript transport, deterministic generation, docs and release tools"
  ],
  "audit_fixes": [
    "Pure joined cancellation is treated as normal shutdown while explicit faults and mixed real failures remain failures",
    "Generated config snapshots accept zero-length model ID phantom arrays while rejecting real hidden mutable references",
    "HTTP completion callbacks retain active/admission ownership until actual return, including early rejected requests",
    "Separated application provider assembly from builder declarations and removed obsolete completion code",
    "Added different-config parallel app isolation and ordinary/plugin route merge/collision regressions",
    "Preserved an explicit error when an opened log destination is rejected without an underlying I/O error"
  ],
